### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8081/api/threat/health

### Start Session
POST http://localhost:8081/api/threat/session/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "S-test-001",
  "domain": "example.com",
  "userAgentHash": "abc123hash"
}

### Analyze Behavior (Generic)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/threat/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "S-test-001",
  "domain": "example.com",
  "url": "https://example.com/login",
  "path": "/login",
  "referrer": "https://google.com",
  "redirectCount": 1,
  "eventType": "password_focus",
  "actionType": "sensitive_action",
  "pageCategory": "sensitive_page",
  "fieldType": "password",
  "averageClickGapMs": 220,
  "clicksLast10Sec": 12,
  "pagesVisitedLast30Sec": 4,
  "tabSwitchCount": 2,
  "copyPasteCount": 1,
  "formSubmitCount": 1,
  "timestamp": "2026-05-03T22:00:00"
}

### Get Risk Logs
GET http://localhost:8081/api/threat/logs

### Get Session
GET http://localhost:8081/api/threat/session/S-test-001